{"sections":[{"slug":"凝聚层上同调","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"凝聚层上同调"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层上同调</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“凝聚层上同调”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>1956 <span lang=\"zh\">年</span> Hirzebruch <span lang=\"zh\">发表了层论在代数几何中的应用的书</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那时同调论只研究实或复的代数簇</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其上带有通常的拓扑</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">但是层和上同调明显也可用于任意域上带</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑的代数簇</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于常值层</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span> $\\mathbb Z$), <span lang=\"zh\">这个理论产生不了有趣的结果</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但对于凝聚代数层</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">上同调理论很有意义</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">许多几何问题可化为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">或一般的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的截面的存在性</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而上同调可表达截面存在的阻碍</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">仿射情形的消失定理</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Cartan定理A,B","text":"Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> A, B"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">指出</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\mathcal F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Stein流形","text":"Stein <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的凝聚解析层</span>,</p>\n"}]}}}]}